[
    {
        "content": "<p>On defining a recursive function that calls itself on a wellfounded subtype of the input, I get an error claiming <code>(kernel) deep recursion detected</code>. My main issue here is looking into the details behind its conclusion, or how (where) to convince Lean that it does terminate due to the recursive call being well founded. <code>decreasing_by</code> contains no section for it, and due to the vagueness I can't tell whether the issue is simply due to the fact that the type might be infinite. All other topics I've found related to deep recursion are due to overly large numbers being used, which this doesn't have, so this may end up being a fundamental issue that Lean is correctly identifying.</p>\n<p>Here is the ~MWE, with the wellfoundedness omitted since it's quite long due to the mutual block (e.g.  proving <code>(AMα.pre sα.2).depth &lt; ϕ.depth</code>):</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PointedModel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Agents</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Props</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">States</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">point</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">States</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Props</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">States</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">mutual</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DELForm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Agents</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Props</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bot</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">update</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">AMα</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PointedActionModel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Agents</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Props</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ϕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DELForm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Agents</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Props</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PointedActionModel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Agents</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Props</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">states</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">point</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">states</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">pre</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">states</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DELForm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Agents</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Props</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">delForces</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">Agents</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">Props</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">States</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">              </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PointedModel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Agents</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Props</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">States</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">              </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ϕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DELForm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Agents</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Props</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ϕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DELForm</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bot</span><span class=\"w\">           </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">False</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DELForm</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">update</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AMα</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ϕ'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">preα</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">delForces</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">States</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">AMα</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pre</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AMα</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">point</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\">--Causes deep recursion error</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">newStates</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Subtype</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">sα</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">States</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AMα</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">states</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                      </span><span class=\"n\">delForces</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">States</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">point</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sα</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">AMα</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pre</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sα</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">2</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">delForces</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">newStates</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                  </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">point</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AMα</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">point</span><span class=\"o\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">preα</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                    </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Props</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sα</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sα</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">val</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ϕ'</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">--termination_by (ϕ.depth, ϕ.sizeOf)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">decreasing_by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">all_goals</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>P.S. I'm never quite sure if this should be something in <code>new members</code> or not, my bad if it should be.</p>",
