    {
        "content": "<p>Update: It turns out the deep recursion was actually being caused by the coercion of <code>(M.point, AMα.point)</code> to the subtype <code>newStates</code>. It then complains about trying to prove that <code>{M with point := M.point}</code> is equal to <code>M</code>.<br>\nYou can just avoid this by changing <code>preα</code> to definitionally be within the subtype:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">delForces</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">Agents</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">Props</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">States</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">              </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PointedModel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Agents</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Props</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">States</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">              </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ϕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DELForm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Agents</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Props</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ϕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DELForm</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bot</span><span class=\"w\">           </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">False</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DELForm</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">update</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AMα</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ϕ'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pre</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">sα</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">States</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AMα</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">states</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                      </span><span class=\"n\">delForces</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">States</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">point</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sα</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">AMα</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pre</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sα</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">preα</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pre</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">point</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AMα</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">point</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">delForces</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Subtype</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pre</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                  </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">point</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AMα</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">point</span><span class=\"o\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">preα</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                    </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Props</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sα</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sα</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">val</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ϕ'</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">--termination_by (ϕ.depth, ϕ.sizeOf)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">decreasing_by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">all_goals</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
